>Gauntlets of Power	Good at the early levels, for carrying and damage.

	For the earlier levels, yes, but later on Gauntlets of
Dexterity become more useful.  18/** Strength is as good as or better
than 25, and is reachable by natural means.  Increased Dexterity also
increases your chance to hit, giving you a combat advantage similar to
that provided by Gauntlets of Power.

>Boots of Speed		Hey, double attacks.
>Cloak of Displacement	Is it better than invisibility?

	No, but since you can get intrinsic Invisibility through other
means, I wouldn't worry about cloaks of Invisibility.  Stealth is also
important, but it too is often attainable through other means (boots,
rings, or class intrinsics).  Imho, Displacement is only better than
Protection in that you occasionally get an interesting message.

>Shield of Reflection	This seems to be very very rare.

	It's also the only shield that does anything other than add to
your AC.  It's really handy.

